/*
	Ideas:
		- Http client
		- RFID
		- Buzzer : vbeeper
		- LED

	Once we find a tag:
		- we translate it into an ID
			- known id vs unknown ids
		- we build a request
		- we make an http request on superscale to set this bloc
		- if button is pressed we save


	=> have a list of known IDs, we load from disk, we update on the server, but we keep a local copy.
		=> we only update it if it's a new id

 */

